An array of content generated by the model is in the `output` property of the response. In this simple example, we have just one output which looks like this:

```json
[
  {
    "id": "msg_67b73f697ba4819183a15cc17d011509",
    "type": "message",
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "output_text",
